      <!-- CENTRAL MESSAGE -->
      <section class="central-message animate delay-2">
        <div class="msg-label">Central Finding</div>
        <div class="msg-text">Persistent Mediocrity with Growing Fragility</div>
        <div class="msg-sub">Global growth isn't collapsing, but it's not recovering either — hovering in a narrow 3.0–3.3% band, well below the pre-pandemic 3.8% average, while the balance of risks remains consistently tilted to the downside.</div>
