          <span class="icon-badge blue">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 17l6-6 4 4 8-8"/><path d="M17 7h4v4"/></svg>
